  "sources": [
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/notion/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Use `NOTION_RETRIEVE_PAGE` instead of deprecated/invalid `NOTION_GET_PAGE`"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/notion/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Use the current Notion page and data-source update triggers"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/notion/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Notion page/database access is granted per integration, not per Composio auth config token"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/notion/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Specifying a different auth config affects get/use lookup, not existing Notion token refresh"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/notion/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Notion 401 can be caused by invalid refresh token after user/admin revokes integration"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/notion/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Use `NOTION_FETCH_DATA`, not `NOTION_FETCH_NOTION_DATA`"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/notion/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Large unfiltered Notion responses can hurt agent quality"
    }
